# Keep secrets and host-specific junk out of the BUILD CONTEXT, not just out of the image.
# No COPY in the Dockerfile reaches .env, but the daemon still receives everything the context
# holds, and that context is 391 MB without this file - 335 MB of which is a macOS .venv that
# could not run in a Linux image anyway.
#
# NOTE: data/raw IS copied by the Dockerfile (market data + exchange_info). Do not exclude it.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.venv/
venv/
.git/
.gitignore
.github/

state/
reports/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal

**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

.DS_Store
*.swp
